      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "CameraAnimation + FreezeFrame, as a soon to be VRC content creator, would be absolutely incredible to have! Not only would it make some amazing shots for videos and streams even, but it would make the filming of not only shorts, but also VRC Films/Documentaries a lot easier to stand out.\nUI Color Changing could be a nice little thing too. Just for the sake of cosmetic reasons, but it would be a nice little way to make your menu look unique. Maybe even add image support for it too!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
