  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-07-27T12:10:16.420Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "-CameraResChanger: able to taking picture up to 16k Resolution\n-CameraMinus: able to enlarge, shrinking the camera\n-CameraAnimation: able to setup a route for camera to go/fly following that route (able to loop)\n-FreezeFrame: able to create a freeze frame locally of self avatar at that specific moment when activated can be stacked and removed (make it able to recording player movement and play it back if possible please)\n-Playerlist (if possible): convenient UI to see  the list of all player in current world (showing Ping/FPS)\n-ViewPointTweaker (if possible): able to set view point position conveniently in game instead of doing it in unity\n-UI color changing (if possible): able to custom menu UI color\nThis is some personally and friends suggestion, but i think there will be alot of user also want these feature so if you do like to implement these feature into the game it would be really great for most of user who love to taking picture and filming\nOther great feature has been suggested by other user and i also upvoted it so if you have a check and also implement into the game we would be really appreciate it",
